    "Initial failures are part of the campaign: one old-client bootstrap timeout and one launcher identity failure were repaired before successful follow-up checks.",
    "The two successful leader-fault durations are end-to-end orchestration intervals, not pure RTO, election time, or first-new-write latency.",
    "Full restart was graceful all-JVM stop/start with ephemeral Pod filesystems still mounted; no Pod stop/termination, physical power loss, disk loss or availability-zone loss was tested.",
